The purpose of the Association is to further the protection of the natural environment with a focus on the ocean and the responsible use of natural marine resources in France and abroad. To this end, it raises awareness among the general public, the business industry and investment community relevant to the use of the marine environment and its resources, and more broadly, the international community as a whole.
In particular, the Association is active in:
	the protection of wild fauna and flora and of biodiversity;
	the fight against pollution and nuisances;
	the prevention of natural and technological risks;
	the preservation of natural environments and balances, and improvement of the quality of life in urban or rural environments;
	science and education with the aim of improving scientific marine knowledge

